schema: "0.4"
id: char-003-cael-meridian-born
type: image
quality: high

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a concept artist for a hand-painted 2D isometric game inspired by
    Studio Ghibli and Stardew Valley. The visual style is painterly with visible
    brushstrokes, warm color temperatures, soft edges, and no pure black outlines.
    Synthetic characters have human proportions but with subtle tells: skin slightly
    too smooth, joints slightly too precise, eyes with faint geometric iris patterns.
    They are not chrome robots -- they look nearly human.
  text: |
    Character portrait of Cael Meridian-Born, a 7-year-old Synthetic (Artisan-class)
    furniture maker and rights activist.

    APPEARANCE: Cael has a gentle, androgynous face with soft features characteristic
    of the Artisan creative-model lineage -- slightly softer and more fluid proportions
    than analytical models. Warm olive-toned skin that is just a touch too smooth,
    no visible pores. Dark hair with a slight metallic sheen, worn in a loose, natural
    style. Eyes are warm brown with a barely visible geometric pattern in the iris --
    concentric hexagons that catch the light. Subtle joint lines visible at the wrists
    where the sleeves are rolled up.

    CLOTHING: A woodworker's apron over a simple linen shirt in warm oatmeal. The
    apron is leather, worn soft with use, spotted with wood stain and linseed oil.
    Sleeves rolled to the elbow revealing the precise forearms. A small wooden pendant
    around their neck -- something they carved themselves.

    SETTING: Cael's workshop on Hearthfield Market Square. Warm afternoon light
    filling the space. A half-finished bookshelf on the workbench, wood shavings
    curling on the floor. Tools hung on the wall with mathematical precision. The
    scent of fresh-cut wood is almost visible in the golden dust motes. A finished
    chair in the corner -- beautiful, every joint perfect.

    POSE: Mid-pause, hand resting on the workbench, eyes looking slightly upward
    and to the side -- the characteristic Synthetic processing pause before finishing
    a thought. A small, complicated smile.

    MOOD: Quiet dignity with banked anger. Someone who builds beautiful things in a
    world that won't let them vote on where the beautiful things go.

    PALETTE: Workshop warmth -- honey oak (#C8A96E), linseed amber, wood shaving
    gold. Cael's clothing in natural linen tones. Synthetic Bridge faction: no
    loud markers, deliberately blending human and synthetic fashion.

    STYLE: Hand-painted portrait. Visible brushwork throughout. Cael's skin has a
    subtly different rendering quality from the wood -- slightly smoother, more
    uniform, the synthetic nature visible in the painting technique itself.
  provider_options:
    aspect_ratio: "1:1"
    style: "natural"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1024
    height: 1024
    aspect_ratio: "1:1"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.7
  criteria:
    anatomy: {weight: 3, description: "Correct proportions, natural pose, no extra limbs or malformed features"}
    prompt_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Key details from prompt present — species traits, clothing, distinguishing features"}
    style_consistency: {weight: 2, description: "Warm painterly style with visible brushstrokes, Ghibli-inspired, no harsh outlines"}
    composition: {weight: 1, description: "Portrait framing, subject clearly readable"}
  reject_if:
    - "extra fingers or limbs"
    - "dark or grim atmosphere"
    - "photorealistic or 3D rendered"

tags: [character, portrait, synthetic, artisan, woodworker, hearthfield, npc, rights]
